  - .
  - .
  - I mean, take a look at yourself.
  - You have no hand and feet.
  - Are you a ghost?
  - Maybe, maybe not
  - Your soul might have gone from your body itself
  - Then you asked, where is my body?
  - In the hospital, right now
  - You are not dead, yet not alive either.
  - But why?
  - A bus, the scream, shattered glass and blood
  - See these strange things? They were on that bus
  - .
  - .
  - And you are the driver.
  - .
  - .
  - .
  - You won't be able to escape.
